Z||000000||Doni Hagan||09-13-2001||12:33 AM||||I've been getting e-mail messages from people saying I've sent them a file containing a virus. The file is titled "DONI'S FIERO FILE" and is attached to a message asking for some advice. I DID NOT SEND THIS FILE!!! Somehow, it's using my corporate e-mail address which I rarely use because I can't access it anywhere but the studio. I've received it myself (as has my wife) and there's no way on Earth I'd e-mail MYSELF from my own studio. <P>Bottom line: If you get something from me and the address is dhagan@rdi-eclipse.com  DON'T OPEN IT!! <P>The techie at the studio is trying to get to the bottom of it.  <p>[This message has been edited by Doni Hagan (edited 09-13-2001).]||||reg||4
